<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZSE details weighting changes in NZSE-30 Index.</title>
<headline>NZSE details weighting changes in NZSE-30 Index.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Stock Exchange on Wednesday announced the following changes to the weighting of Air New Zealand 'B' shares, Telecom shares and Tranz Rail shares in the NZSE-30 Index, to take effect on May 1.</p>
<p>* The number of Air New Zealand 'B' shares to be excluded from the NZSE-30 is zero.</p>
<p>* The number of Telecom ordinary shares to be excluded from the NZSE-30 is 915,643,618. Notification of the number of indexed shares for Telecom, also to apply from May 1, will be advised next week.</p>
<p>* The number of Tranz Rail ordinary shares to be excluded from the NZSE-30 is zero.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
